%SIXMD 1
# @?MV - RENAME FILES

## @?OPERANDS

### @?OLD
EXISTING PATH TO RENAME.

### @?NEW
NEW PATH NAME.

## DESCRIPTION

MV RENAMES OLD TO NEW THROUGH THE NATIVE VFS RENAME OPERATION.
USAGE IS 'MV OLD NEW'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
